# Elastic Documentation Guidelines for LLMs

This repository packages the Elastic docs writing standards into a practical, reusable toolkit for AI-assisted content generation.

## Goals

- Generate docs that match Elastic's content type structure
- Enforce style, tone, grammar, and formatting rules
- Standardize how-to, overview, tutorial, troubleshooting, and changelog writing
- Make AI output reviewable, editable, and publishable

