## How to use

### Option 1: LLM chat UI

1. Copy `SYSTEM_PROMPT.md` or `prompts/system-prompt-base.txt`
2. Paste it into the system or custom instructions area
3. Then send a task like:
   - "Create a how-to guide about configuring Elasticsearch in Docker"
   - "Write an overview of data streams"
   - "Draft a troubleshooting page for no logs in Kibana"
4. Include the relevant template from `templates/`

### Option 2: API usage

Use `prompts/api-json-prompt.json` as a starting payload for OpenAI/Anthropic/Gemini-compatible workflows.

## Content types included

- How-to guides
- Overviews
- Tutorials
- Troubleshooting pages
- Changelogs

## Core rules

- Write for real users, not for internal teams
- Use clear instructions and simple structure
- Prefer active voice
- Use present tense
- Keep content scannable
- Use the correct content type structure
- Avoid unsupported claims and invented details

